WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:05.560
Hold on tight! We are almost to the bottom.
Stay alert.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.080
Only those who honor the Maker's hand may cross this threshold.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.590
Forgive us, forgotten thoughts.
Your story remains written here.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:55.340
You are trapped in the quiet dark,
where all unfinished lines come to rest.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:02.840
Messy ink blots and discarded drafts deserve
peaceful, pure white blankness. You will be erased.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.450
I will draw the lines to set them free.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:10.670
The path is clear now.
